WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
AI OFF, CITY ON：技术可以退场，公共基线必须常在。
AI can exit; the civic baseline must remain.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
众智安全红利场：把测试转成可触摸安全模块与公开失败档案。
Safety Dividend Yard turns trials into touchable safety modules and a public failure archive.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
AI原点开源红利工场：把技术转成开放适配器、维修手册与共学能力。
Open Dividend Works turns technology into open adapters, repair manuals and shared learning.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
大钟寺日常红利客厅：把服务转成触觉地图、有人目录与申诉路径。
Everyday Dividend Commons turns services into tactile maps, staffed directories and appeal routes.
